                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        $p=⟨$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$,\\,0,\\,3⟩\\,,$ \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                                \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        $q=⟨0,\\,-3,\\,$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-2}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$⟩\\,,$ \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                                \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        $r=⟨0,\\,$ \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-3}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$,\\,3⟩\\,.$" :question/worked-solution "Remember that in general, if a point $A$ has coordinates $({a}_{x},{a}_{y},{a}_{z}),$ then its position vector is given by\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{OA}=⟨{a}_{x},{a}_{y},{a}_{z}⟩.\n$$\n\nHere, the point $P$ has coordinates $(0,0,3),$ so its position vector is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p & =⟨0,0,3⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe point $Q$ has coordinates $(0,-3,2),$ so its position vector is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}q & =⟨0,-3,2⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe point $R$ has coordinates $(0,4,3),$ so its position vector is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =⟨0,4,3⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-168031/field-1" "q-168031/field-2" "q-168031/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14223e47-647d-5b4d-a877-694192638d49"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-168031"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-168034/field-1/7336f16cf9437bd809ce5e09d7dc666eb175d0cf5c31ff077c77f0542ed57f13" :answer/id #uuid "ef29f893-65fb-59d0-9762-8412bd3c7952" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/va